cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this dataset, please cite it using these metadata.
type: dataset
title: "Humanities Data Benchmark: complete stored results"
abstract: >-
  Every stored result of the Humanities Data Benchmark as joinable tables:
  3,805 runs, 166,380 requests and 3,902,043 metric observations covering data through 2026-10-29.
  Apart from the framework's own test benchmarks, nothing is filtered: unscored,
  failed and unresolved runs are rows carrying a
  status rather than omissions.
version: 2026-10-29.5
